BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 364.0 Td (Question: A simply supported beam carries a centered 16 kN point load.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 350.0 Td (1. Vertical equilibrium: R_A + R_B = 16 kN.) Tj ET
